| Producer first ownership | The typed Native submission path builds from immutable identity then runs the strict `PulsarNativePreparedRecordValidator` immediately before transport, including exact record binding, artifact set, activation, signature, current Handoff policy and resolved credential fingerprint. | Live authority is not cached. Validation failure is local definite with zero Producer calls; after transport ownership, ambiguous completion remains UNKNOWN. |

